00:15:30.334 --> 00:15:32.434
Look at this guy.
-So cute.

00:15:32.434 --> 00:15:34.467
-Yeah.
-This is me.

00:15:34.467 --> 00:15:36.567
-Yeah.

00:15:36.567 --> 00:15:40.100
Was making music always
the plan for this little man?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:44.801
And also, when did you realize
how talented you were?

00:15:44.801 --> 00:15:47.767
-When I was in middle school.

00:15:47.767 --> 00:15:49.601
-Yeah.

00:15:49.601 --> 00:15:52.934
-I found interesting dance.

00:15:52.934 --> 00:15:59.834
And since then, it was always
my dream to perform on stage.

00:15:59.834 --> 00:16:01.167
-Yeah, always.

00:16:01.167 --> 00:16:03.567
And could you imagine
how big it's gotten?

00:16:07.167 --> 00:16:08.267
Yeah. No, no.

00:16:08.267 --> 00:16:10.200
It's the biggest thing
in the world.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:13.567
Jimin, you have a lot
of nicknames, by the way.

00:16:13.567 --> 00:16:15.267
Mo-- Mochi?

00:16:15.267 --> 00:16:16.567
-Mochi!

00:16:16.567 --> 00:16:19.601
-Chim Chim.
-Chim Chim.

00:16:19.601 --> 00:16:21.334
-Little Prince.

00:16:21.334 --> 00:16:23.167
-Little Prince?
-Yeah.

00:16:23.167 --> 00:16:24.767
Yes. Dooly.

00:16:24.767 --> 00:16:26.934
-Dooly?
-Dooly.

00:16:26.934 --> 00:16:29.734
Yeah. That's one of your --
Do you have a favorite nickname?

00:16:29.734 --> 00:16:34.734
-My favorite nickname
is Jimin Fallon.

00:16:34.734 --> 00:16:36.067
[ Laughter ]

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.200
-I didn't make it say that.
I did not make him say that.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.267
That's so good. Thank you.

00:16:47.667 --> 00:16:51.767
Over the summer,
you and the rest of the guys

00:16:51.767 --> 00:16:55.934
got to go
to the White House and...

00:16:55.934 --> 00:16:58.133
meet with the president,
Joe Biden.

00:16:58.133 --> 00:17:00.100
That is such a big deal.
Was it --

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.367
How important
and how big was this for you?

00:17:02.367 --> 00:17:03.367
-Oh.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:17:24.067 --> 00:17:25.968
People --
People go nuts for you.

00:17:25.968 --> 00:17:27.634
They freak out
when they see you.

00:17:27.634 --> 00:17:28.400
I was --

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.000
[ Audience screaming ]

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.701
He's right here! I know!

00:17:33.701 --> 00:17:35.834
I freak out.
I'm freaking out, too.

00:17:35.834 --> 00:17:37.767
I'm freaking out right now.

00:17:37.767 --> 00:17:40.701
Is there anyone that you --
that you have met

00:17:40.701 --> 00:17:44.000
that you get starstruck
when you've met?

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.300
-Oh, first Jimmy Fallon.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:50.033
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:17:50.033 --> 00:17:54.434
-Maybe you.
You're so funny and sweet.

00:17:54.434 --> 00:17:55.801
-Thank you.
-And...

00:17:55.801 --> 00:17:58.167
-Who for real, though?

00:17:58.167 --> 00:18:00.267
[ Laughter ]

00:18:00.267 --> 00:18:02.033
-And Halsey.
-Halsey.

00:18:02.033 --> 00:18:03.834
-Halsey.
-Oh, really?

00:18:03.834 --> 00:18:07.467
-She has --
She has a big heart.

00:18:07.467 --> 00:18:11.033
And she has the talent

00:18:11.033 --> 00:18:16.567
that would make
anyone starstruck.

00:18:16.567 --> 00:18:18.100
-Yeah.

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:21.067
-All our members love her.

00:18:21.067 --> 00:18:24.667
-Yeah, everyone loves her.
We love Halsey, too.

00:18:24.667 --> 00:18:26.567
Let's talk about
your new album, "Face."

00:18:26.567 --> 00:18:28.267
-This is...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:18:28.267 --> 00:18:31.934
It is officially out now.

00:18:31.934 --> 00:18:33.934
It is out.

00:18:33.934 --> 00:18:36.567
-Out now!
-It's out!

00:18:36.567 --> 00:18:37.834
-Can you -- I know.

00:18:37.834 --> 00:18:39.334
Can you talk about
the inspiration for this album

00:18:39.334 --> 00:18:42.334
and what it represents to you?

00:19:07.868 --> 00:19:09.234
Absolutely.
Yeah.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:13.501
And when you have a new song,

00:19:13.501 --> 00:19:16.601
do you play it
for the rest of BTS?

00:19:28.968 --> 00:19:31.033
And do you listen
to anyone else?

00:19:31.033 --> 00:19:33.000
-Um...

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.400
[ Laughter ]

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.767
-A little bit?
-Maybe.

00:19:37.767 --> 00:19:41.033
-I have a question for you.
This is an honest question.

00:19:41.033 --> 00:19:44.634
I didn't prepare this,
but I have this problem,

00:19:44.634 --> 00:19:46.133
and I want to know
if you can help me.

00:19:46.133 --> 00:19:50.534
I go to a concert
and I feel like I'm too old

00:19:50.534 --> 00:19:52.434
to go to a show.
I just don't know --

00:19:52.434 --> 00:19:54.634
Well, here's -- Help me out.
I have a problem.

00:19:54.634 --> 00:19:58.267
I go to a concert, I don't know
how to dance at a concert.

00:19:58.267 --> 00:20:01.267
And I was wondering if you could
maybe teach me a dance

00:20:01.267 --> 00:20:03.634
that could be --
I could do anywhere.

00:20:03.634 --> 00:20:05.234
-Oh, sure.
-You could?

00:20:05.234 --> 00:20:07.734
-Okay. Stand up. Come on.

00:20:07.734 --> 00:20:09.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:20:09.868 --> 00:20:12.334
Here.

00:20:12.334 --> 00:20:13.400
Okay.
-Okay. Yeah.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.000
-Let's go.
-Okay.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.367
-Come closer.

00:20:18.667 --> 00:20:20.701
Touch my hand.

00:20:20.701 --> 00:20:21.901
And look at the camera.

00:20:21.901 --> 00:20:24.334
That's it.
-That's it?

00:20:24.334 --> 00:20:27.801
Wow.
I do that at a concert?

00:20:27.801 --> 00:20:28.801
Alright. Ready? Ready?

00:20:28.801 --> 00:20:34.267
♪♪

00:20:34.267 --> 00:20:39.701
♪♪

00:20:39.701 --> 00:20:41.467
Evening, everybody.

00:20:41.467 --> 00:20:42.634
"Face" is out now!

